      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Persona governance detail · `$persona`\n**Synthetic telemetry only.** This view filters bounded observations by a server-mapped demo persona. It does not infer authorization, purpose, audience, room access, or identity from browser input. Counter and table panels show current observability-task totals; the time selector applies to the latency chart.",
