      },
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 3},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Observed persona scope\n`$persona`\n\nThe selector uses only the bounded `gluevenir.persona` span attribute. Purpose, audience, memory room, journey, and organizational identity are intentionally absent from exported telemetry.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Server-mapped persona",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
